      "widgets_values": [
        "MorphGS setup (one-time): install this node via Manager (install.py runs automatically), then Blender needs to be on PATH. If you'll use Preprocess Video, download an SV4D/SP4D checkpoint from stabilityai/sv4d2.0 or stabilityai/sp4d on Hugging Face and drop it in your ComfyUI models/sv4d folder (created automatically) -- it'll show up in the sv4d_mode dropdown below.\n\nPipeline order: Preprocess Character + Preprocess Video can run in either order or in parallel, then Train & Render, then (optional) Export Animated Mesh for a downloadable .glb/.fbx instead of just a rendered video -- wired here into ComfyUI's native \"Preview 3D & Animation\" node so you can view/orbit the animated result."
      ],
